'''Silvally''' (Japanese: '''シルヴァディ''' ''Silvady'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Extradimensional Crisis}} expansion.

