==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Silvally|184}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Silvally}}.
*'''Brave Buddies''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Silvally-GX|184}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

